                        "entry_id": "50c0a090-973c-3784-b5aa-06e406fdf0a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Unvarying, calm and steady; constant and uniform."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6fc6165f-0618-4f0c-85bc-32e4198a6673",
                                "sense_id": "353229a0-2e80-3f1d-b25b-9498c1460b26",
                                "text": "The cheerful influence of the morning seemed to have some effect, even upon his equable temper."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "826b0d84-e70b-4e34-94bb-3d0fa300a1e0",
                                "sense_id": "353229a0-2e80-3f1d-b25b-9498c1460b26",
                                "text": "Turning to the prisoner, \"Budd,\" he said, and scarce in equable tones, \"Budd, if you have aught further to say for yourself, say it now.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4cba60fa-987b-3970-907d-f840815cd9f4",
                        "entry_id": "50c0a090-973c-3784-b5aa-06e406fdf0a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Free from extremes of heat or cold."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of temperature"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66c93725-4437-45be-a3b1-ae0f29f42c4f",
                                "sense_id": "4cba60fa-987b-3970-907d-f840815cd9f4",
                                "text": "The indulgences of habit she would not resign, therefore held by the pleasures of the table; but the comforts of equable heat, which was particularly necessary, she denied herself much too long, and resisted warm clothing most determinately;..."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
